<title>UK: Bankgesellschaftsbank sets 100 bln lire bond.</title>
<headline>Bankgesellschaftsbank sets 100 bln lire bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Cariplo London and Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BGB FINANCE IRELAND PLC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  BANKGESELLSCHAFT BERLIN GROUP, BERLINER BANK AND</p>
<p>LANDESBANK BERLIN</p>
<p> AMT    100 BLN LIRE  COUPON    *9.0 PCT   MATURITY    27.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE   FIXED/FRN     ISS PRICE  101.375   PAY DATE    27.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    99.75</p>
<p>NOTES *TO YEAR TWO, THEN 18.0 PCT MINUS TWO TIMES 12MTH LIBOR</p>
<p>(BEQ)</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> IBCA	 AAA	 DENOMS (M) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS</p>
<p>US/GB/DE/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  GOV LAW    ENGLISH</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.625</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
